## 7. Context trail handoff

The `/record` skill at `.cursor/skills/record/SKILL.md` writes cross-agent
context-trail entries into `docs2/context/`. After writing a record, the
skill MUST push to both remotes per §1. A record that is not on both remotes
is invisible to a fresh agent on the other tower.
